  "item_short_desc": "<p>Get ready to tackle the elements with Rothco's Reversible 3/4 Length Rain Parka. The waterproof parka offers versatile protection in windy and stormy conditions. With the reversible design, you get 2 distinct colors in 1 jacket, allowing you to adapt to different weather conditions and outfits. The attached hood provides extra protection, while 2 large flap pockets offer secure storage for your EDC essentials. Air vents under the arms enhance ventilation, preventing overheating and moisture buildup for added comfort during outdoor activities.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "1657",
  "description": "<p>Get ready to tackle the elements with Rothco's Reversible 3/4 Length Rain Parka. The waterproof parka offers versatile protection in windy and stormy conditions. With the reversible design, you get 2 distinct colors in 1 jacket, allowing you to adapt to different weather conditions and outfits. The attached hood provides extra protection, while 2 large flap pockets offer secure storage for your EDC essentials. Air vents under the arms enhance ventilation, preventing overheating and moisture buildup for added comfort during outdoor activities. Crafted from 70% PVC / 30% Rubber, this weather-resistant parka is durable and built to withstand the elements, ensuring reliable protection wherever you go.</p>",
